From: disco-flying-wing-fpv
Subject: [PATCH] RcReceiver peripheral: the Disco's receiver for a hobby radio

The Disco's flight program handles the ARSDK Rc feature (a hobby radio's
receiver on the C.H.U.C.K.: S.BUS or SUMD), but GroundSdk had no
peripheral for it, only the generated ArsdkFeatureRc. Add RcReceiver
(receiver state and protocol, enable, channel monitoring, neutral and
min/max calibration per action, inversion, supported actions), its core,
and the Disco's controller (published for the Disco only).
---
